{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Genre:</strong> Third-Person Shooter / Melee Combat / Brawler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this chaotic battlefield, you are not the only prey\u2014mutant spiders, flamethrower soldiers, berserk axemen\u2026 They fight among themselves, yet could tear you apart at any moment. As the lone survivor, your only goal is simple: <strong>stay alive as long as possible</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies also fight each other, creating ever-changing situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-range machine guns excel at distant targets, while shotguns unleash devastating power up close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you run out of ammo, draw your machete and clash with enemies head-on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy turrets to suppress enemies, or teleport to escape danger and break through desperate situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for mysterious crates scattered across the battlefield to obtain powerful items that keep you alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space</strong> \u2013 Teleport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>T</strong> \u2013 Use Medkit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G</strong> \u2013 Throw Grenade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E</strong> \u2013 Interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>W, A, S, D</strong> \u2013 Move</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039180?t=1760256740","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039180?t=1760256740","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039180/ca60af4655ce8bb533b4a7bf709eb2d61833cc6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1